[00:00.00] 作词 : 子健
[00:01.00] 作曲 : 子健
[00:02.00] 编曲 : 刺猬/陆希文
[00:03.00] 制作人 : 陆希文
[00:35.66]it can't be right
[00:41.21]it can not be right
[00:47.37]one game on
[00:53.17]another shame on
[00:59.17]i need a fresh start
[01:05.04]the whole world needs a fresh start
[01:11.57]there is no ending for this
[01:17.09]there is no way out for ease
[01:46.90]i have seen so many lives
[01:58.63]i have been there so many times
[02:11.46]i never tasted it before
[02:17.04]so i drifted into this war
[02:23.37]humiliations with a storm of failures beat me inside out
[02:28.97]and they still think it's all your fault
[02:34.86]am i alive
[02:41.11]i hoped i was really dead
[02:47.40]one night comes
[02:53.22]another night i am down
[03:22.93]i have dreamed so many nights
[03:34.66]i have wasted too much time
[03:46.69]do i really need it
[03:52.65]or it is just like a game well pre-designed
[03:58.79]got me hurt so bad
[04:01.59]i can't even understand why
[04:04.71]i was just dead for a very long time
